  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Locus of the image of the point <math> <mrow> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow> </mrow> </math> in the line <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mi>x</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mi>y</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <mi>k</mi> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>y</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mi>,</mi> <mo>k</mo> <mo>&#8712;</mo> <mo>R</mo> <mi>,</mi> <mo></mo> </mrow> </math> is a</p>",
